    "detailed_description": "After Corruption is a retro survival horror game inspired by the early days of PSX.<br><br>A extra-dimensional virus has infected, and destroyed the known world. You play as an agent of an organization created to study the breach and try to restore the world to a stable place<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>- third person/fixed camera<br>- 7 environment types to explore<br>- procedurally generated levels<br>- random puzzles<br>- weird/gross/horrifying bosses<br>- cheesy cutscenes<br>- moving while aiming<br>- old-school tank controls<br>- nostalgic vertex jiggle<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Third Person Action Combat</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080620/extras/a1fe3e95cb3ac40f88f1f8ec3dc5ae27.poster.avif?t=1667349004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080620/extras/a1fe3e95cb3ac40f88f1f8ec3dc5ae27.webm?t=1667349004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080620/extras/a1fe3e95cb3ac40f88f1f8ec3dc5ae27.mp4?t=1667349004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use Elements To Adapt</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080620/extras/6d070a46e441a1e1f548eddb12d32802.poster.avif?t=1667349004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080620/extras/6d070a46e441a1e1f548eddb12d32802.webm?t=1667349004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080620/extras/6d070a46e441a1e1f548eddb12d32802.mp4?t=1667349004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Movement-To-Reload system</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m